  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbetet omfattas av ett seminarium &quot;Energy from solid waste&quot; vilketkommer att h&#xE5;llas f&#xF6;r beslutsfattare p&#xE5; alla niv&#xE5;er ansvariga f&#xF6;r av- falls och energifr&#xE5;gor i Polen. Seminariet kommer att t&#xE4;cka kunskap och erfarenheter fr&#xE5;n Sverige bl a i omr&#xE5;det &#xE5;tervinning av energi ur avfall.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ccoperation comprises the seminar &quot;Energy from solid waste&quot; which will be held for decisionmakers at central, regional and local level responsible for waste and energy issues in Poland. The seminar will cover knowledge and experiences from Sweden in the areas of how energycan be gained from solid waste.</narrative>
  </description>
